  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added MAVLink 2 Signing support using HMAC-SHA256\n\t\t\t- Added support for passphrase-based keys (SHA-256) and random key generation\n\t\t\t- Added timestamp validation with configurable window (default: 10 seconds)\n\t\t\t- Added ErrorReason.BadSignature and ErrorReason.SignatureLengthInvalid\n\t\t\t- All signing operations are thread-safe with internal locking",
